OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear spells but
OL,7,Fcloud will soon increase with rain
OL,8,Ffollowing from the west after
OL,9,Fmidnight, this heavy at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FCloudy with rain and drizzle
OL,12,Fduring the morning. Staying rather
OL,13,Fdull and cloudy through the day with
OL,14,Fsome patchy light drizzle at times,
OL,15,Fchance of limited clearer spells
OL,16,Ftowards evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
