OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,6,Fband of cloud and rain, some heavy,
OL,7,Fpasses slowly southeast Tuesday into
OL,8,Fearly Wednesday. Drier Wednesday into
OL,9,Fearly Thursday. Rain and strong winds
OL,10,Fwill then push southeast later
OL,11,FThursday.
